    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "AAACc3////8\u003d",
        "filename": "services/java/com/android/server/am/ActivityManagerService.java",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1965,
      "author": {
        "id": 1010111
      },
      "writtenOn": "2012-01-27T14:22:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can already distinguish the ones running with system UID.\nWe want to also be able to distinguish platform apps from third party apps.\nWilling to do this based on signature; will change this test to one that checks the signature against the one on the android base package.\nHowever, given that Android already supports signatureOrSystem permissions in its own model, is it unreasonable to also pass down an indicator of whether the app came from the system partition to the policy engine, and leave it up to the policy writer to decide whether/how to use that information?",
      "parentUuid": "AAACYX////U\u003d",
      "revId": "1603dfef3a9d781573113af7eb22948303e3618f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "AAACc3////U\u003d",
        "filename": "services/java/com/android/server/am/ActivityManagerService.java",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 1965,
      "author": {
        "id": 1010111
      },
      "writtenOn": "2012-01-30T15:45:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We experimented with introducing a new ApplicationInfo flag for packages that match the platform package cert, but very few packages seem to be signed by that cert.  What we want is a way to distinguish third party apps.  At the operating system level, there are differences in the typical (and desired) accesses by system apps and third party apps, and we want to be able to allow some accesses only to the system apps.  Right now the system flag seems the best way to do that.  Not sure how to proceed.",
      "parentUuid": "AAACYX////U\u003d",
      "revId": "1603dfef3a9d781573113af7eb22948303e3618f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
